abstract: >-
  A compact CUHK-X activity-recognition system combining shared spatiotemporal
  encoding, masked multimodal fusion, protected adapters, deterministic
  supervision routing, and evidence-gated structural decoding under a 100 MB
  runtime-asset limit.

